      "writtenOn": "2025-10-30T17:47:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Also, tegra210 is one of the targets for tegra gki on my fork. This \npatchset makes it impossible to build the tegra124-cpufreq driver which \nis used by tegra210. I can make a downstream commit to drop the changes \nto Kconfig.arm once android17 forks and I start working on it, but \nthat\u0027s not preferable.",
      "parentUuid": "ae716879_0eea862f",
      "revId": "f30c0990cacde42fada63dce43dfd2c22480aa75",
